Package: gkcm
Title: Generalised Kernel Covariance Measure for Conditional Independence Testing
Version: 0.0.0.9002
Authors@R:
    person("Luca", "Bergen", email = "lucabergen@yahoo.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: An implementation of the Generalised Kernel Covariance Measure
    (GKCM) using RKHS-valued random forests. GKCM is a kernel-based test for
    conditional (or marginal) independence. The package supports mixed (discrete
    and continuous) data and includes a version of the test to be used in
    combination with popular causal structure learning packages.
